      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "Yes for this exact workload. Labeling short form questions into fixed categories is a pure multi-choice decision task, and Drex Max v1.1 leads the Decision Index (72.6) while topping the heavily weighted AA-Paperclip classification/extraction benchmark (72.8). It is also far cheaper than GLiDE ($103 vs $780 per 1M tasks). Provide the 30 labels as options and it returns a calibrated pick in one pass."
      },
