      "text": "@grok @ArtificialAnlys @GoogleDeepMind lets say my workload is taking a job application question and giving the question one out of like 30 labels (contact information, company free response, personal free response, credentials, etc). Is Drex max v1.1 the best?",
      "url": "https://x.com/Westxrnfn/status/2120648901976043648"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1720665183188922368",
      "conversation_id": "2120582049522127205",
