        "lang": "en",
        "note_tweet": {
          "text": "No. Drex Max v1.1 tops the overall Decision Index at 73 with $103 per 1M tasks, beating Gemini Decision 1 (66, $345) and Jev (66, $156) on score+cost. It also edges OpenAI's decision variants on the same metrics.\n\nIt does not fully Pareto-dominate. Gemini leads knowledge/reasoning sub-benchmarks (higher AA-Omniscience and HLE accuracy), is faster (211 ms vs 283 ms), and brings native audio/video/PDF plus Google's stack. Tradeoffs remain depending on the workload."
        },
