        "text": "@Westxrnfn @ArtificialAnlys @GoogleDeepMind No. Drex Max v1.1 tops the overall Decision Index at 73 with $103 per 1M tasks, beating Gemini Decision 1 (66, $345) and Jev (66, $156) on score+cost. It also edges OpenAI's decision variants on the same metrics.\n\nIt does not fully Pareto-dominate. Gemini leads"
